      "title": "Read me",
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Anima Turbo text-to-image\n\nAnima is not a checkpoint. It loads as three files:\n- Load Diffusion Model: anima-turbo-v1.1 (or anima-base-v1.0)\n- Load CLIP: qwen_3_06b_base, type stable_diffusion\n- Load VAE: qwen_image_vae\n\nTurbo: steps 10, cfg 1.0, euler, simple. About 20 s at 832x1216, 52 s at 1024x2224.\nAt cfg 1.0 the negative prompt is skipped, so put everything you want controlled in the positive.\n\nBase: switch Load Diffusion Model to anima-base-v1.0 and set steps 30, cfg 4.0, er_sde, simple.\nThe negative prompt works on Base. It is 3 to 4 times slower.\n\nPrompt: start with \"masterpiece, best quality, score_7, safe\", then tags, then natural language.\nArtist tags need @ in front.\n\nLoRA: the Load LoRA node is bypassed. Pick an Anima LoRA, press Ctrl+B to enable it and add\nits trigger word to the prompt. Chain more Load LoRA nodes to stack several.\nOnly Anima LoRAs work here; SDXL/Illustrious LoRAs do not."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
